(7027302, 1065988, 114233, '<td valign="top">I want to love this more but the horison being in the middle is bugging me a bit. I would have moved closer to the water, used a slow shutter speed to blur the crashing waves and used the moving water as your FG in the bottom third</td>', 'I want to love this more but the horison being in the middle is bugging me a bit. I would have moved closer to the water, used a slow shutter speed to blur the crashing waves and used the moving water as your FG in the bottom third', '2013-04-26 08:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
