(7028401, 1066027, 112739, '<td valign="top">Very good work here. Not overdone in any way. Love all the details as far as the eye can see. I think your choice to set up at the distance you did was a good choice, it puts it all into proper scale.</td>', 'Very good work here. Not overdone in any way. Love all the details as far as the eye can see. I think your choice to set up at the distance you did was a good choice, it puts it all into proper scale.', '2013-04-28 20:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028402, 1066051, 124815, '<td valign="top">very interesting fragmentation by the light<br/>as I look at it again, a cropped sky would make the picture more clean and thus more powerful, especially since we lose the quasi vignette at the top (totally unnecessary btw).<br/>bump</td>', 'very interesting fragmentation by the lightas I look at it again, a cropped sky would make the picture more clean and thus more powerful, especially since we lose the quasi vignette at the top (totally unnecessary btw).bump', '2013-04-28 21:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
