(7028718, 1066071, 113591, '<td valign="top">My mother always used to tell us how we were born, on our birthdays. Even when we were 40 to 50 years old. Not the actual delivery, that would be the end paragraph. All about my father leaving on a hunting trip even after being warned by my mother that her time is near, and the doctor''s date is wrong. And then the ensuing trouble, in all it''s hilarious detail. <br/> <br/>Did you see  Fatso, Stinky, and Stretch flying by? hehe.</td>', 'My mother always used to tell us how we were born, on our birthdays. Even when we were 40 to 50 years old. Not the actual delivery, that would be the end paragraph. All about my father leaving on a hunting trip even after being warned by my mother that her time is near, and the doctor''s date is wrong. And then the ensuing trouble, in all it''s hilarious detail.  Did you see  Fatso, Stinky, and Stretch flying by? hehe.', '2013-04-29 03:48:48.000000', NULL, 0),
