(7028828, 1065841, 108069, '<td valign="top">I think it''s the light that takes it over the top. Wonderful depth shown off by some nice contrast, very nice tones. The leading line of a path never hurts. It''s beautifully processed as well. Great photo.</td>', 'I think it''s the light that takes it over the top. Wonderful depth shown off by some nice contrast, very nice tones. The leading line of a path never hurts. It''s beautifully processed as well. Great photo.', '2013-04-29 10:00:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7028833, 1065841, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really pretty!  How did you process it?</td>', 'Really pretty!  How did you process it?', '2013-04-29 10:06:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7028845, 1065841, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> Really pretty!  How did you process it? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Evening shot with the light behind me. Some tonemapping using Topaz adjust and the tonal contrast in Color Efex. Some selective editing to make the path stand out a bit more. Some of the glamour glow from color efex, applied a bit heavier in the foliage areas. And a slight dark vignette to help guide the eye where I wanted it to go.</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: Really pretty!  How did you process it?  Evening shot with the light behind me. Some tonemapping using Topaz adjust and the tonal contrast in Color Efex. Some selective editing to make the path stand out a bit more. Some of the glamour glow from color efex, applied a bit heavier in the foliage areas. And a slight dark vignette to help guide the eye where I wanted it to go.', '2013-04-29 10:29:03.000000', NULL, 0),
