(7040233, 1065984, 152252, '<td valign="top">" After all, my landscape photo is of the Colorado mountain wilderness. This would be poorly understood by an urbanite from old Europe."<br/> <br/>I found this description very insulting and I wasn''t going to comment on it because I didn''t want to go to that level but I will now. I don''t know if you noticed but Tiny had mountains in the picture he submitted (it didn''t look wild, but it''s still mountains). I grew up in Carpathian mountains (totally wild area) and I also thought this picture was kind of undefined when I first looked at it. But what do we Europeans know with our Alps, Pyrenees and Carpathians, right?</td>', '" After all, my landscape photo is of the Colorado mountain wilderness. This would be poorly understood by an urbanite from old Europe." I found this description very insulting and I wasn''t going to comment on it because I didn''t want to go to that level but I will now. I don''t know if you noticed but Tiny had mountains in the picture he submitted (it didn''t look wild, but it''s still mountains). I grew up in Carpathian mountains (totally wild area) and I also thought this picture was kind of undefined when I first looked at it. But what do we Europeans know with our Alps, Pyrenees and Carpathians, right?', '2013-05-20 01:55:42.000000', NULL, 0),
