(7041126, 1065984, 39057, '<td valign="top">Wow...the Alps ! They make the Rocky''s look like the hills of Birmingham, Alabama !<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by beatabg:</b></div><hr/><i> " After all, my landscape photo is of the Colorado mountain wilderness. This would be poorly understood by an urbanite from old Europe."<br/> <br/>I found this description very insulting and I wasn''t going to comment on it because I didn''t want to go to that level but I will now. I don''t know if you noticed but Tiny had mountains in the picture he submitted (it didn''t look wild, but it''s still mountains). I grew up in Carpathian mountains (totally wild area) and I also thought this picture was kind of undefined when I first looked at it. But what do we Europeans know with our Alps, Pyrenees and Carpathians, right? </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Wow...the Alps ! They make the Rocky''s look like the hills of Birmingham, Alabama ! Originally posted by beatabg: " After all, my landscape photo is of the Colorado mountain wilderness. This would be poorly understood by an urbanite from old Europe." I found this description very insulting and I wasn''t going to comment on it because I didn''t want to go to that level but I will now. I don''t know if you noticed but Tiny had mountains in the picture he submitted (it didn''t look wild, but it''s still mountains). I grew up in Carpathian mountains (totally wild area) and I also thought this picture was kind of undefined when I first looked at it. But what do we Europeans know with our Alps, Pyrenees and Carpathians, right? ', '2013-05-21 17:05:20.000000', NULL, 0),
